      "TEXT": "Goblin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Milonia text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Peasant\n\u0022Thank you for saving our city! Goblins raided our lands and destroyed our crops... I wish to warn you, they are numerous further south.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Tanscroul text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire\n\u0022Thank you for liberating us! There was no justice to be found here before you came... All followed Erhog - we were forced to serve her!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Agreban text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage\n\u0022The Ammennir family ruled these lands before Hubert de Lalye accused them of heresy. Since then, chaos has spread throughout the realm...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Jaignes Port text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman \n\u0022Hubert de Lalye, the Emperor\u0027s Counselor, often visited this city... Why did he not help us against Erhog? The Emperor has abandoned these lands, I fear!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Erhog in front",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Erhog the Dark\n\u0022Do not be so self-confident. Remember, Death is my master! I will serve her well by destroying you... If you are no fool, leave while you can...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Event2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022I smell the foul stench of sulfur! Advance with caution, for the lands ahead are inhabited by demonic beasts...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Event3",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Look at that! The cultists have burned everything in sight...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T15",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "High Priest\n\u0022The Emperor has been poisoned! Corrupt nobles sent by Erhog attempted to assassinate him. He survived the attack, but will soon perish if we don\u0027t find an antidote to Erhog\u0027s concoction!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Event5",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Many peasants have warned us about Athlok\u0027s Keep. Beware, Milord! It is said that lost souls haunt it...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T3",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "High Priest\n\u0022Milord, many nobles have fled the capital... Erhog and her evil disciples are surely behind this! Be cautious...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Event7",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022We have found a valuable man in this town, he goes by the name of Wolfgar. He is willing to fight for our cause...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN002e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Event8",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage\n\u0022We found cabalistic symbols inside this ruin! A powerful poison was brewed here recently. I wonder why...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN002f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T20",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage\n\u0022Milord, the stars tell me that a  savior will come to our aid! He will be of royal blood...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0031",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cultist",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0033",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Erhog T35",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Erhog the Dark\n\u0022Why do you persist in your attempts to defeat me? Your fate is already sealed, Highfather servant! Ah ah ah ah!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc\n\u0022GHOOOOAAR ! You fell into Orc trap. Now you fight me to pass mountains!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Win Scenario",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "As Erhog vanished from beneath her crumbling tower, she shouted:  \u0022We will meet again, Highfather\u0027s dogs !\u0022   \nThe antidote to cure the Emperor Demosthene was found in the rubble and promptly sent to him.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "EventDouble",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022We should advance with caution... I believe the Legions of the Damned\u0027s territory lies ahead!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0039",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "StartEvent",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "High Priest\n\u0022You have arrived at last, Milord! Erhog the Dark and her evil sect control these lands... The few who dared speak against her have disappeared. Her temple is somewhere in the southeast. You must end this madness!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN003a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "SubQuestEvent",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Milord, the peasants say that the Ogre has concealed an important item in its lair... Some think the treasure was created at the same time as a statue located further north-east.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "SubQuest2Event",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022The Stone Ring of Ammennir fits the statue\u0027s finger perfectly! Look Milord, a hidden door has opened... there is an ancient book!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN003d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T8",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duke \n\u0022Leave these lands, Humans... Suffering and death awaits all who dare to oppose the Legions of the Damned.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Archmage \n\u0022We must not falter, Milord! Be not  alarmed... although it seems Erhog has now allied with these demonic beings!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duke \n\u0022You have been warned, mortals! We will scorch the lands and burn your flesh...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN003e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
